  "_comment": "26.3: FirstPersonHandsAndItemsRendererMixin owns the submitHandsWithItems call site for TACZ viewmodels, so generic first-person hand transforms yield without affecting ordinary items. FirstPersonHandsAndItemsMixin carries the KeepingItemRenderer state, which 26.3 moved off the renderer onto client.player.FirstPersonHandsAndItems. PlayerModelMixin applies TACZ/PAL third-person poses from AvatarRenderState.",
